@startuml UC69_SendInvoiceEmail
!theme plain
title UC69: Gửi email hóa đơn

actor System
participant "Backend Service" as Service
participant "Email Service" as Email
database "Database" as DB

System -> Service: Event: Thanh toán thành công / Chốt hóa đơn\n(bookingId, invoiceId)
Service -> DB: Tìm invoice theo ID\n(populate booking, customer)
DB --> Service: Invoice data

Service -> DB: Tìm booking theo ID\n(populate room, services)
DB --> Service: Booking data

Service -> Service: Generate invoice PDF\n(invoice details, booking info, services)
Service -> Service: Create PDF buffer

Service -> Email: Gửi email hóa đơn\n(to: customer.email, invoice PDF attachment, booking details)

Email -> Email: Attach PDF file\n(filename: HoaDon_{invoiceId}.pdf)
Email --> Customer: Email với hóa đơn PDF\n(kèm chi tiết booking)

note right
  Email bao gồm:
  - Invoice PDF attachment
  - Chi tiết booking (phòng, ngày, dịch vụ)
  - Tổng tiền và trạng thái thanh toán
  - Link xem invoice online
end note
@enduml

